1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
How many people before two share a birthday?

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:08,000
Most people guess about a hundred and eighty.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,200
It is twenty-three.

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:16,800
Because you solved the wrong problem. You asked about you.

5
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:21,200
Nobody said it had to be you. Any two will do.

6
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:25,600
A room of twenty-three holds two hundred and fifty-three pairs.

7
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:31,200
Every one of those is its own chance to collide.

8
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:36,800
You counted yourself. The room was counting pairs.
